beckons with history.After breakfast, we drove to Jodhpur. Soon after check-in, we visit the amazing places of the Blue city which includes:\nUmmaid Bhawan Palace Museum - Legacy of royal grandeur.\nJaswant Thada - Peaceful memorial in marble.\nMehrangarh Fort - Citadel of indomitable spirits.\nOvernight stay at Jodhpur hotel.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Jaisalmer", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false, "guest_self_booked_hotel": false, "vehicle_type": "AC Car", "pickup_location": null, "drop_location": null, "guide_required": false, "activities": [], "images": [], "internal_notes": "", "client_notes": "", "operations_notes": "", "status": "planned", "completion_pct": 0, "packing_tips": "", "things_to_carry": []}, {"day_uuid": "34301ef9-07dd-a9b9-efca-a7dfdc9fc625", "day_number": 4, "day_title": "Jodhpur – Mount Abu", "alternate_day_titles": [], "day_subtitle": null, "day_theme": "Heritage", "day_description": "Delwara Temple - Exquisite craftsmanship in marble.\nVedi Temple - Devotion amidst serene landscapes.\nNakki Lake - Mirror of tranquility and charm.\nSunset Point - Nature''s canvas at dusk.\nTod Rock - Mystical boulder with tales.\nGuru Shikhar - Peak of spiritual solace.\nAchalgarh Mahadev Temple - Ancient shrine in scenic setting.\nBrahma Kumari Ashram - Retreat for spiritual rejuvenation.\nOvernight stay at Mount Abu hotel.", "start_time": "09:00", "end_time": "18:00", "travel_distance_km": null, "travel_time_minutes": null, "location": "Mount Abu", "hotel_name": null, "room_category": null, "meal_plan": "CP", "breakfast": true, "lunch": false, "dinner": true, "breakfast_hotels": [null, null], "lunch_hotels": [null, null], "dinner_hotels": [null, null], "epai_plan_only": false,